Any direct damage that exceeds [32%, 25%, 21%, 18%, 16% (TL1-5)] of your maximum life has the excess damage converted to a shallow wound that bleeds over the next [3, 4, 5, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns. This bleed cannot be resisted or removed, but can be reduced by Bloodstained. Extremely powerful hits (more than 40% of your max life) are not fully converted.

''You can't just die. That would be too easy.''
